# ...and its sibling, for the same reason: both are build OUTPUTS, reproducible
# with `node tools/build_musiclab.mjs`, and the footer stamps the commit they
# were built from — so committing one always leaves it one commit stale and
# invites an endless restamp. The recorded sample bank under assets/ IS source
# (it cannot be regenerated without the network) and stays tracked.
tools/musiclab.html

